{
  "id": 19180,
  "title": "Do you know?",
  "russian_title": "Ты зна́ешь?",
  "level": "Beginner",
  "torfl_level": "A2",
  "hsk_tags": [
    "A2"
  ],
  "slug": "do-you-know",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/19180_do-you-know.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Did you know? There is a university next to my home. This university has 30,000 students and more than 2,000 teachers. It is the best school in the city. Also because my home is next to the university, eating and shopping are very convenient. There are many shops and restaurants around, including Yunnan food, Sichuan food, Cantonese food...you can have whatever you want. There is a mountain behind this university, which is very famous. Many people come here to travel, and both Chinese and foreigners like to come here to climb mountains. Because I like climbing mountains and chatting with different people, I became a tour guide and was happy every day."
  ],
  "english_full": "Did you know? There is a university next to my home. This university has 30,000 students and more than 2,000 teachers. It is the best school in the city. Also because my home is next to the university, eating and shopping are very convenient. There are many shops and restaurants around, including Yunnan food, Sichuan food, Cantonese food...you can have whatever you want. There is a mountain behind this university, which is very famous. Many people come here to travel, and both Chinese and foreigners like to come here to climb mountains. Because I like climbing mountains and chatting with different people, I became a tour guide and was happy every day.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Ты зна́ешь? О́коло моего́ до́ма есть университе́т. В э́том университе́те 30 000 студе́нтов и бо́льше 2 000 наста́вников. Э́та школа лу́чшая в го́роде. То́же, потому что мой дом ря́дом с университе́том, при́нятие пи́щи и поку́пки очень удо́бные. Вокру́г много магази́нов и рестора́нов, включая пи́щу Юньна́ня, пи́щу Сычуа́ня, канто́нскую пи́щу... ты можешь взять всё, что хо́чешь. Сза́ди университе́та есть гора́, кото́рая очень изве́стная. Многие лю́ди прихо́дят здесь, чтобы пое́здить, и и́ китайцы, и иноземцы любя́т при́ходить сюда́, чтобы воссо́йти на го́ры. Поскольку я люблю́ восходи́ть на го́ры и болтать с друго́ми людьми, я ста́л проводни́ком и был счастлив кажды́й день."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ty znáesh? Ókolo moegó dóma yest' universitét. V étom universitéte 30 000 studéntov i bólshe 2 000 na stávnikov. Éta shkola lúchshaya v górode. Tózhe, potomu chto moy dom rjádom s universitétom, prínyatie píshchi i pokupki óchen' udobnye. Vokrug mnogo magazinov i restoránov, vklyuchaya píshchu Yunnánya, píshchu Sychuánya, kantónskuyu píshchu... ty mozhesh vzýat' vse, chto khóchesh. Szádi universitéta yest' gorá, kotóraya óchen' izvéstnaya. Mnogie líudi prikhodýat zdes', chtoby poézdit', i í kitaitsy, i inozemtsy lýbiyut prikhodit' syudá, chtoby vosxоdit' na góry. Potómu chto ya lyublý vуsходit' na góry i boltat' s druǵimi lýud'mi, ya stál provodníkom i byl schastliv kazhdýj den'."
  ],
