  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "story_19180_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Ты зна́ешь?",
      "text_en": "Did you know?",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ty\" data-defn=\"ты\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Ты</span><rt>Ty</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"znáesh&#x27;\" data-defn=\"знаешь\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зна́ешь</span><rt>znáesh&#x27;</rt></ruby>?",
      "transliteration": "Ty znáesh'?",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.02,
      "duration": 1.02
    },
    {
      "id": "story_19180_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "О́коло моего́ до́ма есть университе́т.",
      "text_en": "There is a university next to my home.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ókolo\" data-defn=\"около\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">О́коло</span><rt>Ókolo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"moegó\" data-defn=\"моего\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">моего́</span><rt>moegó</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dóma\" data-defn=\"дома\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">до́ма</span><rt>dóma</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"est&#x27;\" data-defn=\"есть\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">есть</span><rt>est&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"universitét\" data-defn=\"университет\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">университе́т</span><rt>universitét</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Ókolo moegó dóma est' universitét.",
      "start": 1.37,
      "end": 3.41,
      "duration": 2.04
    },
    {
      "id": "story_19180_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "В э́том университе́те 30 000 студе́нтов и бо́льше 2 000 наста́вников.",
      "text_en": "This university has 30,000 students and more than 2,000 teachers.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"V\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">В</span><rt>V</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"étom\" data-defn=\"этом\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">э́том</span><rt>étom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"universitéte\" data-defn=\"университете\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">университе́те</span><rt>universitéte</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"30\" data-defn=\"30\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">30</span><rt>30</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"000\" data-defn=\"000\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">000</span><rt>000</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"studéntov\" data-defn=\"студентов\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">студе́нтов</span><rt>studéntov</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ból&#x27;she\" data-defn=\"больше\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">бо́льше</span><rt>ból&#x27;she</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"2\" data-defn=\"2\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">2</span><rt>2</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"000\" data-defn=\"000\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">000</span><rt>000</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nastávnikov\" data-defn=\"наставников\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">наста́вников</span><rt>nastávnikov</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "V étom universitéte 30 000 studéntov i ból'she 2 000 nastávnikov.",
      "start": 3.76,
      "end": 6.57,
      "duration": 2.81
    },
    {
      "id": "story_19180_p0_c3",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "Э́та школа лу́чшая в го́роде.",
      "text_en": "It is the best school in the city.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Éta\" data-defn=\"эта\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Э́та</span><rt>Éta</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shkola\" data-defn=\"школа\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">школа</span><rt>shkola</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lúchshaya\" data-defn=\"лучшая\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">лу́чшая</span><rt>lúchshaya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"v\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">в</span><rt>v</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"górode\" data-defn=\"городе\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">го́роде</span><rt>górode</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Éta shkola lúchshaya v górode.",
      "start": 6.92,
      "end": 8.66,
      "duration": 1.74
    },
    {
      "id": "story_19180_p0_c4",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "То́же, потому что мой дом ря́дом с университе́том, при́нятие пи́щи и поку́пки очень удо́бные.",
      "text_en": "Also because my home is next to the university, eating and shopping are very convenient.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Tózhe\" data-defn=\"тоже\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">То́же</span><rt>Tózhe</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"potomu\" data-defn=\"потому\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">потому</span><rt>potomu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"moy\" data-defn=\"мой\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">мой</span><rt>moy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dom\" data-defn=\"дом\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">дом</span><rt>dom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ryádom\" data-defn=\"рядом\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ря́дом</span><rt>ryádom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"universitétom\" data-defn=\"университетом\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">университе́том</span><rt>universitétom</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"prínyatie\" data-defn=\"принятие\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">при́нятие</span><rt>prínyatie</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"píshchi\" data-defn=\"пищи\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пи́щи</span><rt>píshchi</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pokúpki\" data-defn=\"покупки\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">поку́пки</span><rt>pokúpki</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ochen&#x27;\" data-defn=\"очень\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">очень</span><rt>ochen&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"udóbnye\" data-defn=\"удобные\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">удо́бные</span><rt>udóbnye</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Tózhe, potomu chto moy dom ryádom s universitétom, prínyatie píshchi i pokúpki ochen' udóbnye.",
      "start": 9.01,
      "end": 14.2,
      "duration": 5.19
    },
    {
      "id": "story_19180_p0_c5",
      "chunk_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "Вокру́г много магази́нов и рестора́нов, включая пи́щу Юньна́ня, пи́щу Сычуа́ня, канто́нскую пи́щу...",
      "text_en": "There are many shops and restaurants around, including Yunnan food, Sichuan food, Cantonese food...you can have whatever you want.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Vokrúg\" data-defn=\"вокруг\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Вокру́г</span><rt>Vokrúg</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mnogo\" data-defn=\"много\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">много</span><rt>mnogo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"magazínov\" data-defn=\"магазинов\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">магази́нов</span><rt>magazínov</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"restoránov\" data-defn=\"ресторанов\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">рестора́нов</span><rt>restoránov</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vklyuchaya\" data-defn=\"включая\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">включая</span><rt>vklyuchaya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"píshchu\" data-defn=\"пищу\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пи́щу</span><rt>píshchu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Yun&#x27;nánya\" data-defn=\"юньнаня\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Юньна́ня</span><rt>Yun&#x27;nánya</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"píshchu\" data-defn=\"пищу\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пи́щу</span><rt>píshchu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Sychuánya\" data-defn=\"сычуаня\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Сычуа́ня</span><rt>Sychuánya</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kantónskuyu\" data-defn=\"кантонскую\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">канто́нскую</span><rt>kantónskuyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"píshchu\" data-defn=\"пищу\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пи́щу</span><rt>píshchu</rt></ruby>...",
      "transliteration": "Vokrúg mnogo magazínov i restoránov, vklyuchaya píshchu Yun'nánya, píshchu Sychuánya, kantónskuyu píshchu...",
      "start": 14.55,
      "end": 20.35,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "id": "story_19180_p0_c6",
      "chunk_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "text": "ты можешь взять всё, что хо́чешь.",
      "text_en": "There is a mountain behind this university, which is very famous.",
